      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "title": "Logs — Loki driven by $traceId variable (A-12)",
        "description": "Validates A-12: Cross-datasource variable interpolation. The $traceId textbox variable drives this Loki query. Enter a trace ID from the table above to filter logs.",
